Code.NativeIaC:
```bicep
// Bicep: deploy the AKS cluster on a supported Kubernetes version
resource <example_resource_name> 'Microsoft.ContainerService/managedClusters@2024-09-01' = {
  name: '<example_resource_name>'
  location: resourceGroup().location
  identity: {
    type: 'SystemAssigned'
  }
  properties: {
    kubernetesVersion: '<supported_version>' // Critical: set a supported Kubernetes version to pass the check
    dnsPrefix: '<example_dns_prefix>'
    agentPoolProfiles: [
      {
        name: 'systempool'
        count: 3
        vmSize: '<example_vm_size>'
        mode: 'System'
      }
    ]
  }
}
```

Code.Terraform:
```hcl
# Terraform: keep the AKS cluster on a supported Kubernetes version
resource "azurerm_kubernetes_cluster" "<example_resource_name>" {
  name                = "<example_resource_name>"
  location            = "<example_location>"
  resource_group_name = "<example_resource_group_name>"
  dns_prefix          = "<example_dns_prefix>"

  kubernetes_version = "<supported_version>" # Critical: set a supported Kubernetes version to pass the check

  default_node_pool {
    name       = "systempool"
    node_count = 3
    vm_size    = "<example_vm_size>"
  }

  identity {
    type = "SystemAssigned"
  }
}
```
